            {
              "id": "1764197304475_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "**Instructions:\nParse output : {{$context.$nodes.TASK_CREATED_BY_WAVE.$output.output}}\n\n\n**Output Format\n\n*Task Created\nWave : [Wave number]\nTotal Task Created: \nTask Type : [Breakdown by task type]\n\n*No Task Created \nWave : [Wave number]\nTotal Task Created: \n{insights: if task template is empty, but there are allocations with status < 99. This means user needs to configure a Wave Template on the Wave. If there is a wave template, and the allocation status <99. This means the selection criteria of the task template was not met and couldn't create task]\n\n\n** Do not show task_type_id"
            }
          ],
          "type": "LLM"
        },
