              "id": "1764886912397_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "#### Instructions\nDisplay  {{$context.$nodes.CUBING.$output.output}}\n\nFormatting Guidelines:\n\nDo not include the word \"{summary\" or any key-value pair labels in the response.\nProvide the information directly in plain text.\nAlways start the response by clearly stating the Wave ID, followed by the relevant message or data."
            }
